Looking at the current script (I should recall its structure from the file), there's a loop that determines the maximum end time of the segment draw animations and then sets `--fill-delay` accordingly:

```js
root.style.setProperty('--fill-delay', Math.max(0, maxEndTime - 0.04).toFixed(3) + 's');
